<h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Password Reset</h1>
<p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6;">
  We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to create a new password:
</p>
<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
</div>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
  This link will expire in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>.
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #999; line-height: 1.6;">
  If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.
</p>
